{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/12627","tmdb_id":12627,"title":"不羁的美女","original_title":"La Belle Noiseuse","overview":"弗兰霍夫（米歇尔·皮寇利 Michel Piccoli 饰）是一个功成名就的画家，妻子利兹（简·伯金 Jane Birkin 饰）一直都是他创作的源泉和模特，这也是利兹感到自豪的所在。但是这些年来，弗兰霍夫的创作灵感渐渐枯竭，当他面对着妻子的肖像画时，甚至感到无从下笔。当玛利亚娜（艾曼纽·贝阿 Emmanuelle Béart 饰）经朋友介绍出现在他眼前时，他已经有将近十年没有拿起过画笔了。性感奔放的玛利亚娜的出现重新点燃了画家的激情，他们两人在封闭的画室里整日疯狂的作画。利兹努力的克制自己的嫉妒心，但当弗兰霍夫将妻子的肖像画用玛利亚娜的人体覆盖的时候，利兹无法忍耐了，她和画家之间发生了争吵。画作完成了，但弗兰霍夫却做出了一个惊人的举动，他将完美的画作永远的砌进了石墙里，从此，这副杰作将永远的隐藏于黑暗之中。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xI9c3u1XuNt5ACk41Vc2Ybfyi3v.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFXrPXV6GjWK5mQZYMncve0bisi.jpg","release_date":"1991-09-04","year":"1991","runtime":"236 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.3,"tmdb_votes":292,"tmdb_rating":"7.3 / 10 from 292 users","genres":["剧情"],"languages":["English","French"],"countries":["France","Switzerland"],"production_companies":["Pierre Grise Productions","George Reinhart Productions","FR3 Films Production"],"directors":[{"name":"雅克·里维特","id":73153}],"producers":[{"name":"Martine Marignac","id":41021}],"cast":[{"id":3784,"name":"米歇尔·皮科利","original_name":"Michel Piccoli","character":"Edouard Frenhofer","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6yZaIIeMfYgQtcdNo4dubL2N5YT.jpg"},{"id":4885,"name":"艾曼纽·贝阿","original_name":"Emmanuelle Béart","character":"Marianne","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/9zMPQS68UDDahxJQH9ZRiNuWmjU.jpg"},{"id":15200,"name":"简·伯金","original_name":"Jane Birkin","character":"Liz","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/wjYt9WdPVEm0BKF0sWi6RyZREOc.jpg"},{"id":38877,"name":"玛丽安娜·德尼库尔","original_name":"Marianne Denicourt","character":"Julienne","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6Acy9xruMlUgamP5R9kcCicm8Qw.jpg"},{"id":1159702,"name":"David Bursztein","original_name":"David Bursztein","character":"Nicolas","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/9xUvTgDQTHOeTBlnE1MZfy0